      "value": "An additional feature I'd like to see with this would be the choice between how to handle multiple senders inside the box. One option could average the positions out between all senders, and another could be based on order of entry (first, last, etc). As well as a simple bool/float for whether or not something is inside of the object, or perhaps an INT counting how many senders are inside. These could all be very useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
